# --- Open-source hygiene: never commit signing material, local identity or tool scratch ---
# Code-signing / provisioning material (Apple, Android, HarmonyOS, generic)
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.crt
*.p7b
*.mobileprovision
*.keystore
*.jks
.ohos/
apps/mobile/harmony/build-profile.local.json5

# Signing-bearing project files are developer-local. If you must commit a change to them,
# run `git update-index --no-skip-worktree <path>` first and scrub the secrets by hand.
# (skip-worktree is set per clone; see README "Before you push" / scripts/check-secrets.sh)

